    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trans-verbĕro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to strike</i> or <i>beat through</i>, <i>to thrust through</i>, <i>pierce through</i>, <i>transfix</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praeclara bestia venabulo transverberatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 7, 1, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">abiete pectus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 667</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clipei aera (hasta),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 10, 336</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in utrumque latus transverberatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					1, 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aëra volitando,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. de Deo Socr. p. 46, 37</span></i>
			.</div>
